              "height": 250,
              "layer": 3,
              "data": {
                "text": "## A useful first prompt\n\n```text\nRead the open PowerScroll page. Add a third scroll called Questions, summarize what is here, and draw a small Mermaid flowchart showing how this notebook is saved.\n```\n\nEverything the agent creates remains ordinary canvas content you can move and edit.",
                "fontSize": 16,
